{"version":2,"sourceHash":"8ba562241517e1e324fbb5326f4ec69210a15b0a6dae5c333b57fe04c2e0c36e","locale":"zh-TW","id":"ep-25","no":"EP.25","tag":"第25話 · 黑月","title":"黑月","rev":2,"beats":[{"id":"ep-25:1","s":"n","t":"太陽消失的天空下，河水像黑鏡般凝固。風停了，連水霧也懸在空中，一動不動。","bg":"eclipseSky","tone":"dark","bgm":"zeroPoint","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-25:2","s":"yeon","t":"我去。往哪兒走。上面？河裡？","x":"angry","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"angry"},"c":{"who":"moka","x":"angry"},"r":{"who":"yun","x":"serious"}},{"id":"ep-25:3","s":"moka","t":"妳瘋了？它叫妳去，妳就去？那明擺著是陷阱！","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-25:4","s":"yeon","t":"我知道是陷阱。可Yeongnyangi在那裡。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-25:5","s":"yun","t":"女士，對方要的，不是貓先生，是您。貓先生是誘餌。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-25:6","s":"yeon","t":"那就得咬鉤。不咬，誘餌會怎麼樣。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-25:7","s":"n","t":"閏月答不出來。摩卡也閉上嘴。答案，大家都知道。"},{"id":"ep-25:8","s":"n","t":"黑圓周圍的紅環，猛地燃亮。凝固的河水中央，陷下一個圓坑。下面，出現階梯般的影子。","im":true,"fx":"veil","sfx":"glitch","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"veil","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-25:9","s":"heuk","t":"聰明的小豬。我替妳鋪好階梯。朋友也可以帶來。有觀眾，才有意思。","nm":"聲音"},{"id":"ep-25:10","s":"yeon","t":"你是誰。叫什麼名字。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-25:11","s":"heuk","t":"名字啊。你們總是先問名字。好。今天免費給一個。","nm":"聲音"},{"id":"ep-25:12","s":"sys","t":"[ 黑月 · 吞噬光的月亮 ]","im":true,"fx":"script","sfx":"bell","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"script","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 시스템 메시지"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-25:13","s":"n","t":"文字彷彿刻在天空，浮現出來，又從邊緣開始燒黑。像連自己的名字，也要吃掉。"},{"id":"ep-25:14","s":"yun","t":"黑月。","x":"pain"},{"id":"ep-25:15","s":"n","t":"閏月掌心的洞，猛烈旋轉。他想重新戴上手套，卻抖得戴不進去。"},{"id":"ep-25:16","s":"moka","t":"騙子，你認識？","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-25:17","s":"yun","t":"不認識。可這個洞認識。從它出現的那天起，就一直只被那個名字牽引。","x":"pain"},{"id":"ep-25:18","s":"n","t":"三人沿著河水下的階梯往下走。階梯像沒有盡頭。牆上密密麻麻全是黑掌印，無一例外，都朝著裡面。","bg":"hands","tone":"dark","bgm":"crisis2","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"hands","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: hands","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"hands 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-25:19","s":"moka","t":"這些手印，都是想爬出去時撓的？還是被拖進去時留下的？","x":"base","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"serious"},"c":{"who":"moka","x":"base"},"r":{"who":"yun","x":"serious"}},{"id":"ep-25:20","s":"yun","t":"都是。被拖進去後，又想爬出去。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-25:21","s":"yeon","t":"那就是說，也有出去的路。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-25:22","s":"moka","t":"豬，妳在這種時候，怎麼還這麼樂觀。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-25:23","s":"yeon","t":"悲觀，階梯就會短一點嗎？","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-25:24","s":"yun","t":"女士說得對。樂觀悲觀，階梯都一樣長。我保證。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-25:25","s":"moka","t":"你們兩個真是一模一樣。都這時候了。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-25:26","s":"n","t":"摩卡從鼻子裡呼出一口氣，像是笑了。階梯盡頭，正透出紅光。"},{"id":"ep-25:27","s":"n","t":"階梯盡頭，竟又是天空。倒掛在河底的天空。中央浮著黑圓，圓下，懸著一個黑線織成的繭。","bg":"eclipseSky","tone":"desat","bgm":"zeroPoint","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"crossfade","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-25:28","s":"n","t":"繭的縫隙裡，露出白毛。繭緩緩鼓起、落下，像在呼吸。","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-25:29","s":"yeon","t":"Yeongnyangi！","x":"fear","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"fear"},"c":null,"r":{"who":"neo","x":"fear"}},{"id":"ep-25:30","s":"neo","t":"別過來。Yeoni，回去。","x":"fear"},{"id":"ep-25:31","s":"yeon","t":"還活著。活著，還能說話。","x":"cry"},{"id":"ep-25:32","s":"neo","t":"聽我的。它不是要抓我，是要抓妳。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-25:33","s":"yeon","t":"我知道。知道了才來的。","x":"cry"},{"id":"ep-25:34","s":"n","t":"纏繭的黑線驟然收緊。Yeongnyangi咬緊牙。線壓過的地方，鏽跡擴散，變得漆黑。","fx":"thread","sfx":"whoosh","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"thread","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-25:35","s":"heuk","t":"幸會，小豬。這樣面對面，還是第一次。雖然，我已經看妳很久了。"},{"id":"ep-25:36","s":"yeon","t":"你哪有臉。就是個洞。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-25:37","s":"heuk","t":"哈哈。沒錯。臉，是借來用的。需要時，借需要的那個人的臉。"},{"id":"ep-25:38","s":"n","t":"黑圓表面泛起波紋。短短一瞬，上面映出Yeoni自己的臉，又消失了。Yeoni脊背發涼。"},{"id":"ep-25:39","s":"yun","t":"女士，別聽它說話。也別和它對視。","x":"serious","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"fear"},"c":{"who":"yun","x":"serious"},"r":{"who":"moka","x":"angry"}},{"id":"ep-25:40","s":"heuk","t":"算命的，你的掌心還餓嗎。我吃剩的時間，正在裡面哭呢。"},{"id":"ep-25:41","s":"yun","t":"呃。","x":"pain"},{"id":"ep-25:42","s":"n","t":"閏月跪倒。掌心的洞自行張開，把他往前拖。摩卡叼住他的衣領，死死撐住。"},{"id":"ep-25:43","s":"moka","t":"騙子，撐住！你被吸進去了，誰給我們看合婚！","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-25:44","s":"yeon","t":"停下！你要的是我吧。對我說。別碰別人。","x":"angry","bgm":"crisis2","shot":"wide","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"steady"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 yeon의 대사"}},{"id":"ep-25:45","s":"heuk","t":"態度不錯。這生意，談得成。"},{"id":"ep-25:46","s":"n","t":"黑圓朝Yeoni傾斜，像巨大的眼睛向下俯視。"},{"id":"ep-25:47","s":"heuk","t":"做個交易。我把貓還給妳。交換條件，是妳剩下的全部運氣。"},{"id":"ep-25:48","s":"yeon","t":"運氣？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-25:49","s":"heuk","t":"妳出生時得到的。還沒用掉的明天。好日子，幸運的日子，偶然一切順利的日子。全部給我。"},{"id":"ep-25:50","s":"yun","t":"女士，不行。把運全掏空，人就會成為容器。空容器，什麼都能裝進去。那才是它要的。","x":"serious","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 yun의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-25:51","s":"heuk","t":"算命的，話真多。對，容器。我不隱瞞。這孩子的乙木藤蔓，連別人的氣息也能接住、包容。這樣的容器，不多見。"},{"id":"ep-25:52","s":"neo","t":"Yeoni，別聽！它是要吃掉妳！","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-25:53","s":"heuk","t":"不是吃掉，是填滿。她所容納的一切，由我來替她使用。"},{"id":"ep-25:54","s":"n","t":"Yeoni仰望繭。線縫間，能看見生鏽的前爪。原本蔓延到肩膀的鏽，已經到了後頸。"},{"id":"ep-25:55","s":"yeon","t":"（運氣還可以再攢。烤串可以再烤，歌可以再唱。Yeongnyangi，只有一個。）","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-25:56","s":"yeon","t":"我答應。","x":"serious","bgm":"gloom2","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 yeon의 대사"}},{"id":"ep-25:57","s":"moka","t":"豬！","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-25:58","s":"yun","t":"女士！","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-25:59","s":"neo","t":"Yeoni，不行！","x":"shock"},{"id":"ep-25:60","s":"yeon","t":"Yeongnyangi，你總替我疼。這一次，讓我來。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-25:61","s":"neo","t":"那是我自己決定的。別替我做決定！","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-25:62","s":"yeon","t":"這句話，原封不動還給你。有沒有用，我來決定。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-25:63","s":"n","t":"Yeongnyangi答不出來。昨天Yeoni說過的話，原樣回到了面前。那時，聽見了，卻裝作不懂的話。"},{"id":"ep-25:64","s":"heuk","t":"契約成立。那麼，叫收帳的來。"},{"id":"ep-25:65","s":"n","t":"黑圓下的影子猛然裂開。黑虎從縫裡走出。斗篷末端濕著，右前爪的金環，在紅光裡泛著光澤。","bg":"eclipseSky","tone":"dark","bgm":"warCommand","shot":"impact","im":true,"fx":"claw","sfx":"thud","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"claw","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-25:66","s":"tiger","t":"您召喚我？","x":"base","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"serious"},"c":{"who":"tiger","x":"base"},"r":null},{"id":"ep-25:67","s":"heuk","t":"打開帳簿。把這孩子剩下的運，全部收走。"},{"id":"ep-25:68","s":"n","t":"老虎看向Yeoni。極短地，她的視線停住。然後，帳簿展開。"},{"id":"ep-25:69","s":"tiger","t":"全部，嗎。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-25:70","s":"heuk","t":"全部。"},{"id":"ep-25:71","s":"tiger","t":"明白。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-25:72","s":"yeon","t":"又是妳。這次不收掌聲，要收什麼。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-25:73","s":"tiger","t":"明天。不會疼。只是，會有點冷。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-25:74","s":"moka","t":"條紋傢伙！妳真要做？豬到底對妳做過什麼！","x":"angry","c":{"who":"moka","x":"angry"}},{"id":"ep-25:75","s":"tiger","t":"水獺，請讓開。契約已經定下了。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-25:76","s":"n","t":"老虎握緊帳簿。那一瞬，右前爪的金環，自行收緊一格。老虎表情絲毫沒變。只有帳簿一角，微微皺了。"},{"id":"ep-25:77","s":"n","t":"帳簿裡Yeoni那一欄，開始抽吸光芒。粉紅，金黃，嫩綠。像小星星的光，一顆顆脫離Yeoni身體，進入帳簿。","im":true,"fx":"suck","sfx":"whoosh","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"suck","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-25:78","s":"n","t":"慶典島第一次嘗到的烤串。正午舞臺的掌聲。露娜分來的半個麵包。每少一件，Yeoni的眼睛就眨一下。"},{"id":"ep-25:79","s":"sys","t":"[ 帳簿 · 乙亥 Yeoni · 正在收回剩餘運氣 ]","sfx":"heartbeat"},{"id":"ep-25:80","s":"yeon","t":"好冷。","x":"fear"},{"id":"ep-25:81","s":"neo","t":"Yeoni。","x":"fear"},{"id":"ep-25:82","s":"n","t":"纏繭的線繃得像要斷了。Yeongnyangi拚命掙扎。越掙扎，線陷得越深。"},{"id":"ep-25:83","s":"yun","t":"水獺先生，那本帳簿。或許，我能用這隻手吸走。","x":"pain","c":{"who":"yun","x":"pain"}},{"id":"ep-25:84","s":"moka","t":"那就快做！快！","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-25:85","s":"n","t":"閏月甩掉手套，把掌心伸向帳簿。洞旋轉著，抓住幾顆光。可下一瞬，洞口像被撕開般，猛然張大。","im":true,"fx":"vortex","sfx":"glitch","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"vortex","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-25:86","s":"yun","t":"啊——！","x":"pain"},{"id":"ep-25:87","s":"heuk","t":"算命的。覬覦別人的容器，你自己的洞，會先破掉。"},{"id":"ep-25:88","s":"n","t":"閏月抓住手腕，倒下了。洞越過掌心，延伸到手腕。摩卡像護在懷裡般，擋住他。"},{"id":"ep-25:89","s":"moka","t":"那我燒了它！","x":"angry","fx":"fire","sfx":"fire","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"fire","camera":"steady"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 moka의 대사"}},{"id":"ep-25:90","s":"n","t":"摩卡擲出火種。還沒碰到帳簿，火種就被黑圓的陰影吸走，熄滅。摩卡尾毛猛地豎起。"},{"id":"ep-25:91","s":"moka","t":"不行。這裡點不著火。","x":"moved"},{"id":"ep-25:92","s":"n","t":"最後一顆光，從Yeoni前蹄尖脫落。很小的一點白光。Yeoni記不起，那曾是什麼。","bg":"eclipseSky","tone":"desat","bgm":"none","shot":"quiet","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-25:93","s":"yeon","t":"好了嗎？","x":"base","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"base"},"c":null,"r":null},{"id":"ep-25:94","s":"n","t":"聲音沒有起伏。粉紅的毛，褪成灰色。眼睛睜著，卻映不出任何東西。"},{"id":"ep-25:95","s":"sys","t":"[ 帳簿 · 乙亥 Yeoni · 無餘額 ]","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 시스템 메시지"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-25:96","s":"n","t":"老虎合上帳簿。合上的前爪，短暫地一顫。她看著Yeoni空蕩的眼睛，轉開了頭。"},{"id":"ep-25:97","s":"tiger","t":"收取完畢。","x":"sad","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"base"},"c":{"who":"tiger","x":"sad"},"r":null},{"id":"ep-25:98","s":"heuk","t":"辛苦了，老虎。現在，該兌現承諾了。"},{"id":"ep-25:99","s":"n","t":"黑線鬆開。繭裂開，白貓落在Yeoni面前。Yeongnyangi一觸地，就撐起身體，爬向她。","bgm":"gloom2","shot":"wide","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-25:100","s":"neo","t":"Yeoni，是我。看著我。","x":"shock","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"base"},"c":null,"r":{"who":"neo","x":"shock"}},{"id":"ep-25:101","s":"yeon","t":"嗯。Yeongnyangi。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-25:102","s":"neo","t":"為什麼這樣做。為什麼。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-25:103","s":"n","t":"Yeongnyangi的聲音破裂了。那是他從未在Yeoni面前發出的聲音。"},{"id":"ep-25:104","s":"yeon","t":"不知道。就是想這樣。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-25:105","s":"n","t":"Yeoni想笑，嘴角卻抬不起來。彷彿連怎麼笑，也隨著運氣，一起進入了帳簿。"},{"id":"ep-25:106","s":"n","t":"Yeongnyangi用前爪環住Yeoni。用的是右爪，不是生鏽的那隻。她的身體，輕得異樣。"},{"id":"ep-25:107","s":"n","t":"這時，Yeongnyangi後頸，又冒出一根黑線。那根線，從來沒鬆開過。它一直延伸到地下，連著黑圓。","im":true,"fx":"thread","sfx":"slash","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"thread","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-25:108","s":"heuk","t":"我說了還給妳。沒說放了他。"},{"id":"ep-25:109","s":"neo","t":"卑鄙的傢伙。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-25:110","s":"heuk","t":"只是帳算得準。跟我的收帳人學學。"},{"id":"ep-25:111","s":"n","t":"黑圓開始下降。周圍的紅環，像巨大的嘴唇張開。裡面，黑手像線團般，一束束散出。","bg":"handsRush","tone":"dark","bgm":"zeroPoint","shot":"wide","scene":{"background":"handsRush","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: handsRush","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"handsRush 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-25:112","s":"heuk","t":"容器空了。真美。現在，該填進去了。","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"base"},"c":{"who":"tiger","x":"surprise"},"r":{"who":"neo","x":"fear"}},{"id":"ep-25:113","s":"n","t":"老虎後退一步。第一次，她臉上掠過什麼。在她身後，黑手朝著空掉的Yeoni，同時張開手指。"}]}
